      "quote": "Dr. Kelly Kisling Dr. Kisling’s research is focused on the development and clinical implementation of automated (knowledge-based) treatment planning in 3D conformal radiotherapy (3DCRT), in particular automated 3DCRT approaches in women undergoing adjuvant RT for breast cancer. Her research is complementary to other RMAS efforts focused on implementing automation in patients undergoing intensity-modulated radiotherapy (IMRT) and brachytherapy. Explore the Lab People Discover the exceptional team of researchers in Dr. Kelly Kisling’s lab. Meet Our Team Publications Dive into the latest publications from Dr. Kelly Kisling’s lab. See Publications Featured Articles Risk Assessment of Automated Treatment Planning Post-Mastectomy Automated Planning Automated Planning in Cervical Cancer",
